{"src":"en","tgt":"id","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"id","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7945.278318,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8499.810619,"text":"Namun, zona Shenzhen berfungsi seperti sebuah negara dalam hal ini."},{"kind":"audio","t":8637.990941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8642.799764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8647.721464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8649.297759,"samples":12315,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":15102.859203999998,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":16013.12893,"text":"Terletak di puncak salah satu gunung di sebelah utara Mekkah, gua tersebut berada sangat dekat"},{"kind":"audio","t":16155.139110999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16159.949543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16165.09496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16170.349444999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16171.153742,"samples":9362,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":17736.98398,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18088.798709000002,"text":"terisolasi dari dunia luar."},{"kind":"audio","t":18143.683124000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18145.882499,"samples":17665,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":26274.318114,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27210.396794,"text":"Sekarang orang-orang menulis pesan di layar komputer tanpa perlu mendekati alat pengasah pena."},{"kind":"audio","t":27348.788323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27353.463338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27358.857641000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27363.887519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":27365.407475,"samples":12148,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":37523.797606,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39065.597991999995,"text":"Para pelancong yang menuju negara-negara dengan pajak yang tinggi terkadang dapat menghemat uang dalam jumlah yang signifikan, terutama untuk produk seperti minuman beralkohol dan tembakau."},{"kind":"audio","t":39308.388858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39313.443766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39318.478254999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39323.518414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39328.875716999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39333.69861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39338.609781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39341.847878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39342.393549,"samples":11201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":45773.28034,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46604.176435999994,"text":"Tumbuhan memproduksi makanannya dari sinar matahari melalui proses fotosintesis. Mereka juga memberikan naungan."},{"kind":"audio","t":46741.020659999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46743.835534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46746.875864999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46750.414608,"samples":32377,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":46753.719574999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46754.704479,"samples":15436,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":58050.705142,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59524.365355999995,"text":"Rumah sakit telah mengikuti protokol pengendalian infeksi, termasuk memisahkan pasien dari yang lain untuk mencegah kemungkinan penularan infeksi kepada orang lain."},{"kind":"audio","t":59741.015883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59746.005153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59751.264848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59756.650101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59761.961896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59767.222020999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59772.512425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59774.479704,"samples":20563,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"input","t":68162.06813099999,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69430.886337,"text":"Pekerjaan yang dilakukan sebagian besar bersifat teoretis, tetapi program tersebut dibuat untuk mensimulasikan pengamatan terhadap galaksi Sagittarius."},{"kind":"audio","t":69628.130698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":69633.309404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69638.374102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69643.555439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69648.872733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69654.309026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69659.149338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69659.709588,"samples":9139,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":78292.293847,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79677.326449,"text":"Bahasa resmi Barcelona adalah Katalan dan Spanyol. Sekitar setengahnya lebih suka berbicara dalam bahasa Katalan, mayoritas memahaminya, dan hampir semua orang tahu bahasa Spanyol."},{"kind":"audio","t":79799.682177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79804.24466299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79807.774336,"samples":22513,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":79891.378738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79896.23902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79901.978318,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79907.064616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79912.321201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79915.808945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79917.210232,"samples":17665,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":83784.013137,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84796.485885,"text":"Di beberapa daerah, cukup merebus air selama satu menit, sementara di daerah lain diperlukan beberapa menit lagi."},{"kind":"audio","t":84950.553692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84955.393734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84960.575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84965.827626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84970.83162499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84973.644109,"samples":19504,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":89845.342635,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91202.18588199999,"text":"Tanaman akan terlihat paling indah ketika berada di lingkungan alami, jadi hindari keinginan untuk memotong setidaknya satu batangnya sekalipun."},{"kind":"audio","t":91371.504923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":91372.673104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91374.218089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91375.74481399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91377.35584799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91378.823365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91379.775629,"samples":23238,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":97259.273839,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98503.171206,"text":"Pada tahun 1920-an, sikap yang umum di kalangan sebagian besar warga negara dan negara-negara adalah pasifisme dan isolasi."},{"kind":"audio","t":98693.851772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98695.055553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98696.531869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98698.098184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98699.654949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98701.07012599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98702.755169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98703.354899,"samples":14154,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":103517.32642499999,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104415.831731,"text":"Masa Serif merupakan predator puncak di zamannya, sehingga ia tidak takut pada apa pun kecuali Mosul lainnya."},{"kind":"audio","t":104558.446552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104559.592754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104561.000241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104562.51398599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104564.036762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104564.592793,"samples":15603,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":113120.270645,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114219.28324399999,"text":"Sejak berdirinya Asunción pada tahun 1537, Paraguay berhasil mempertahankan banyak ciri dan identitas asli bangsanya."},{"kind":"audio","t":114411.75979899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114416.936575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114422.352237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114427.7338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114433.098683,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114438.571704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114442.431422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114443.361037,"samples":13876,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":119857.332365,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120724.109313,"text":"Penyakit ini ditularkan oleh babi, yang kemudian menular ke manusia melalui nyamuk."},{"kind":"audio","t":120826.023773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":120830.967203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120836.05575099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120840.633727,"samples":29312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"input","t":129343.884305,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130526.456281,"text":"Sebagian besar teleskop penelitian modern merupakan fasilitas raksasa yang berada di daerah terpencil dengan kondisi atmosfer yang menguntungkan."},{"kind":"audio","t":130687.45685500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130688.66215499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130690.16858099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130691.673727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130693.31861999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130694.829785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130695.66906199999,"samples":22402,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":135212.844707,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136107.32843700002,"text":"Orang mungkin tidak menyadari bahwa kesabaran dan pengertian juga diperlukan oleh para pelancong."},{"kind":"audio","t":136214.54834100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136219.520231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136224.590329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136229.646267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136230.73917900003,"samples":10476,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":140532.288325,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141110.971347,"text":"Jadi, kemungkinan besar notasi tersebut ditambahkan hanya sebagai label."},{"kind":"audio","t":141209.67006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141214.84612600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141219.998292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141221.98488,"samples":15659,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":147757.698179,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148451.80805300002,"text":"Namun, masih banyak hal mengenai burung yang masih terlihat seperti dinosaurus."},{"kind":"audio","t":148548.93763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148553.593965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148558.88104900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148561.631205,"samples":19560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":154942.767996,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155982.78504000002,"text":"Sebagian besar merupakan pantai berpasir dengan kondisi berenang yang aman, dan sebagian besar memiliki naungan yang disediakan oleh"},{"kind":"audio","t":156133.329923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156138.336592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156143.700305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156148.760054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156154.160826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156159.046497,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"input","t":157892.07568200002,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158157.86581000002,"text":"Pohon Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":158189.683525,"samples":27863,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":164331.960563,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165651.449532,"text":"Duvall, yang sudah menikah dan memiliki dua anak dewasa, tidak meninggalkan kesan yang mendalam pada Miller, yang merupakan orang yang diceritakan kisahnya tersebut."},{"kind":"audio","t":165825.225729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165828.28376000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165831.461138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165834.716736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165837.992983,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165841.423477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165844.68743400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165845.191556,"samples":8860,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"close","t":175905.09437500002,"code":1005}]}